    "text": "## sub_4CC840_004cc840 — ParticleMatrixRotationUpdate\n\n**Summary:** Updates rotation matrix axes for each particle entry in a strided array (10 floats per entry). Computes cross product of scaled direction vectors and normalizes them using magnitude from this[4]. Called to prepare particle orientation before rendering.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (no static path from tick root)\n\n**Called by:** sub_4CC970 (004cc970), ParticleEffectPhysics (004ccb30)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x10 | R | — | particle rotation magnitude / normalization scale factor |\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e440 | flt_59E440 | R | ZeroThreshold (~0.0f, physics clamp) [DERIVED] |\n| 0059e450 | flt_59E450 | R | DegreesToRadians [DERIVED] |\n| 0059ed18 | flt_59ED18 | R | ForceReductionFactor [DERIVED] |\n| 005aceac | flt_5ACEAC | R | MatrixRotationScaleConst [DERIVED] |\n| 005ea510 | dword_5EA510 | R | SessionManager [DERIVED] |\n| 008ac840 | unk_8AC840 | R | MatrixArrayBase [DERIVED] (also: ` — global array base (not in docs/12) |\n| 008acac0 | flt_8ACAC0 | R | ParticleArray_8ACAC0 [DERIVED] |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 0040c870 | VirtualDispatchHelper | resolve session manager pointer for rotation data |\n\n**Guard conditions:** For each entry, checks if normalized vector magnitude squared > 0.0. PASSES: scales each axis by sqrt(magnitude) normalization. BLOCKED (<= 0.0): sets default direction with this[4]*0.5 on X axis, zeros Y/Z.\n"
